CM_ SG_ 640 VHL_1_CL_SUB_TYPE "ENUM describes cluster sub type. If not cluster = 0
Indicates if the cluster of vehicles is mixing oncoming and/or leading vehicles, or not.
INVALID : object is not a cluster
ONCOMING : All objects are oncoming
TAILLIGHT : All objects are leading
LEFT_ONCOMING: Most left object is oncoming, others are leading.
RIGHT_ONCOMING: Most right object is oncoming, others are leading.
LEFT_AND_RIGHT_ONCOMING: Leading objects between most left and right.
LEFT_AND_RIGHT_TAILLIGHT: Oncoming objects between most left and right.
Invalid
Unavailable";
CM_ SG_ 640 VHL_4_CL_SUB_TYPE "ENUM describes cluster sub type. If not cluster = 0
Indicates if the cluster of vehicles is mixing oncoming and/or leading vehicles, or not.
INVALID : object is not a cluster
ONCOMING : All objects are oncoming
TAILLIGHT : All objects are leading
LEFT_ONCOMING: Most left object is oncoming, others are leading.
RIGHT_ONCOMING: Most right object is oncoming, others are leading.
LEFT_AND_RIGHT_ONCOMING: Leading objects between most left and right.
LEFT_AND_RIGHT_TAILLIGHT: Oncoming objects between most left and right.
Invalid
Unavailable";
