CM_ SG_ 640 VHL_1_TYPE "Describes the vehicle light type detected. Indicates oncoming or leading vehicle  In case of a cluster it represents the type of the closest vehicle in the cluster. Clearance = Truck cabin top lights (i.e. oncoming).";
